    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 24.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Wealh, gif he hafað V hida, he bið syxhynde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A Welshman, if he has five hides, is [due a wergild of] 600.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">The wergeld of a Welshman who holds five hides of land shall be 600 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Wealh, gif he hæfð fif hyda, he byþ syxhinde.</ab>
      </div>
